      },
      "body": "Same fix as #39118 for rocm_attn.py: `prefix_scheduler_metadata` is only assigned in the `else` branch (when `use_cascade=False`) but referenced unconditionally in the `TritonAttentionMetadata` constructor. When cascade attention is active, this raises `UnboundLocalError`.\n\nInitialize to `None` before the conditional, matching the pattern in `flash_attn.py` (line 464).\n\nAI-assisted (Claude).",
      "changedFiles": 2,
      "comments": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "Bortlesboat"
            },
            "body": "Added a regression test for the cascade metadata path in `tests/v1/attention/test_triton_attn_metadata_builder.py`.\n\nValidated on the MI300X RunPod with the repo venv and a public `facebook/opt-125m` config:\n- `upstream/main`: `python -m pytest -vv tests/v1/attention/test_triton_attn_metadata_builder.py` -> fails with `UnboundLocalError` from `TritonAttentionMetadataBuilder.build`\n- `fix-triton-attn-unbound-var` (this branch, now with the test): same command -> `1 passed`\n\nThis keeps the repro narrow and exercises the exact `common_prefix_len > 0` cascade path that was missing the local initialization.",
            "createdAt": "2026-04-14T11:46:22Z",
            "databaseId": 4243613696,
            "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T11:46:22Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/39208#issuecomment-4243613696"
          },
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "Bot",
              "login": "github-actions"
            },
            "body": "This pull request has been automatically marked as stale because it has not had any activity within 90 days. It will be automatically closed if no further activity occurs within 30 days. Leave a comment if you feel this pull request should remain open. Thank you!",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-19T02:17:14Z",
            "databaseId": 5013800952,
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-19T02:17:14Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/39208#issuecomment-5013800952"
          },
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "Bortlesboat"
            },
            "body": "Not stale — just re-verified against current `main`: the cascade branch in `TritonAttentionMetadataBuilder.build` still never assigns `prefix_scheduler_metadata` (only the `else` branch does, [triton_attn.py#L211-L226](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/vllm/v1/attention/backends/triton_attn.py#L211-L226)), so any `common_prefix_len > 0` build still hits the UnboundLocalError. The branch is conflict-free against main and includes a regression test for the cascade path.\n\n@tjtanaa @gshtras would appreciate a look when you get a chance — it's a two-line fix.\n",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-19T14:41:21Z",
            "databaseId": 5016130852,
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-19T14:41:21Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/39208#issuecomment-5016130852"
          },
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "Bortlesboat"
            },
            "body": "Closing as obsolete: merged #61126 removed cascade attention, including this builder's `use_cascade` branch and the `prefix_scheduler_metadata` field/argument, in e1a5086256a00c47a968aac6a583c25d040100a7. I checked the removal diff and current main; the unbound-local path addressed here no longer exists. There is no useful rebase of this patch onto the replacement builder. The original MI300X regression evidence remains historical.\r\n",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-18T23:55:32Z",
